{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48780","headline":"太庙祼地歌辞 · 陈叔达","name":"太庙祼地歌辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清庙既裸，郁鬯推礼。\n大哉孝思，严恭祖祢。\n龙衮以祭，鸾刀思啓。\n发德朱弦，升歌丹陛。\n遥享粢盛，堂斟况齐。\n降福穰穰，来仪济济。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}